  <p id="c-jinshu-069-liushan:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-jinshu-069-liushan:p001:m0000" ref="n4t_dv5_dyl">疇</persName>兄子<persName id="c-jinshu-069-liushan:p001:m0003" ref="9b1_c61_00c">劭</persName>，有才幹，辟琅邪王丞相掾。咸康世，歷御史中丞、侍中、尚書、豫章太守，秩中二千石。</p>
